# m5-safe.config — hardware-safety limits for the first native J714s boot (task 10 addendum).
# Merged LAST, after betizzel's fragments. Each line says which rule it enforces.
# No audio (speaker protection unproven on T6050 -> damage risk): whole sound subsystem off.
# CONFIG_SOUND is not set
# CONFIG_SND is not set
# CONFIG_APPLE_SIO is not set
# No SMC write paths (battery charge control, fans, keys): whole Apple SMC stack off.
# CONFIG_MFD_MACSMC is not set
# CONFIG_GPIO_MACSMC is not set
# CONFIG_INPUT_MACSMC_INPUT is not set
# CONFIG_SENSORS_MACSMC_HWMON is not set
# CONFIG_MACSMC_POWER is not set
# CONFIG_RTC_MACSMC is not set
# No cpufreq writes to cluster p-state registers.
# CONFIG_ARM_APPLE_SOC_CPUFREQ is not set
# No GPU / DCP.
# CONFIG_DRM_APPLE is not set
# CONFIG_DRM_ASAHI is not set
# No writes to unknown memory: betizzel's patch 0001 (early fb markers) paints red/green/blue bands at the
# fixed PA CONFIG_OMARCHY_FB_MARKER_BASE=0x10bd3110000 (an m1n1-reported address, stride 0x2f40) at kernel
# entry/MMU/paging/console, and sets up earlycon=efifb at that address. With it off, every hook is an empty stub.
# CONFIG_OMARCHY_FB_MARKERS is not set
